{"unit_id":"tag:025S:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n代数空间（Algebraic spaces）最初由 Michael Artin 引入，见 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>、<REF_0006>、<REF_0007> 和 <REF_0008>。部分基础内容由他与 Knutson 共同建立，后者撰写了著作 <REF_0009>。Artin 将代数空间（algebraic space）定义为（见 <REF_0010>）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）下的层（sheaf），它在平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）下局部可表（representable）。在 Artin 的大部分工作中，所考虑的概形（schemes）范畴（categories）由一个固定的优良（excellent）诺特（Noetherian）基底上的局部有限型（locally of finite type）概形（schemes）组成。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们的定义与 Artin 最初的定义略有不同。具体而言，我们的代数空间（algebraic spaces）是 fppf 拓扑（topology）下的层（sheaves），其对角（diagonal）可表（representable），并且有一个由概形（scheme）给出的平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）“覆盖（cover）”。使用 fppf 拓扑（topology）而非平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）拓扑（topology）只是技术上的一点，几乎没有区别；我们将在《Bootstrap》第 <REF_0011> 节说明，如果使用平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）拓扑（topology），也会得到同一个代数空间（algebraic spaces）范畴（category）。在同一章中，我们将证明对角（diagonal）上的条件在某种意义下可以去掉，见《Bootstrap》第 <REF_0012> 节。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n定义代数空间（algebraic spaces）之后，我们作一些基础性的观察。本章主要结果是：按照我们的定义，代数空间（algebraic space）与平展（<ACCENT_0006>tale）等价关系（equivalence relation）是同一回事，见第 <REF_0013> 节的讨论和定理 <REF_0014>。Artin 的设定下与此定理对应的结果是 <REF_0015> 或 <REF_0016>。换言之，由平展（<ACCENT_0007>tale）等价关系（equivalence relation）定义的层（sheaf）有可表（representable）的对角（diagonal）。因此，我们的定义在广义上与 Artin 最初的定义一致。这也意味着，只需写下一个平展（<ACCENT_0008>tale）等价关系（equivalence relation），就能给出代数空间（algebraic spaces）的例子。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n在第 <REF_0017> 节，我们介绍文献中找到的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的各种分离公理（separation axioms）。最后，在第 <REF_0018> 节，我们给出一些古怪以及不那么古怪的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的例子。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["Michael","Artin","Knutson","Bootstrap","fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"excellent","target_term":"优良"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0005>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0006>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0007>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0008>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"separation axioms","target_term":"分离公理"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_t