{"unit_id":"tag:025T:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们在一个适当的大 fppf 位点（site）<MATH_0001> 上工作，如《拓扑》定义 <REF_0001> 中所述。因此，若未明确作其他说明，所有概形（schemes）都是 <MATH_0002> 的对象（objects）。在第 <REF_0002> 节，我们讨论改变大 fppf 位点（site）时会发生什么变化。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们总是相对于包含在 <MATH_0004> 中的基底（base）<MATH_0003> 工作。然后使用大 fppf 位点（site）<MATH_0005>，见《拓扑》定义 <REF_0003>。取 <MATH_0006> 就能恢复绝对情形。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n若 <MATH_0007> 是 <MATH_0008> 上的概形（schemes），则以 <MATH_0009> 记 <MATH_0010> 值点（points）中<TEXTITOPEN_0001>在<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0011> 上的点所成的集合（set）。用公式表示为：<MATH_0012>。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n注意，任何 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）都是泛有效满态射（universal effective epimorphism），见《下降》引理 <REF_0004>。因此，<MATH_0013> 上的拓扑（topology）弱于典范拓扑（canonical topology），且所有可表（representable）预层（presheaves）都是层（sheaves）。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"值点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"universal effective epimorphism","target_term":"泛有效满态射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"canonical topology","target_term":"典范拓扑"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"值点","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"universal effective epimorphism","target_term":"泛有效满态射","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"canonical topology","target_term":"典范拓扑","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"当前词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
