{"unit_id":"tag:025U:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 是包含在 <MATH_0002> 中的概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0003>。设 <MATH_0004> 是函子（functors）的可表（representable）变换（transformation），见《范畴》定义 <REF_0001>。这意味着对每个 <MATH_0005> 和任意 <MATH_0006>，纤维积（fiber product）<MATH_0007> 都可表（representable）。选择一个表示对象（representing object）<MATH_0008> 及一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0009>。由米田引理（Yoneda lemma）（见《范畴》引理 <REF_0002>），投影（projection）<MATH_0010> 来自唯一的概形（schemes）态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>。直观地说，可以用图（diagram）<MATH_0012> 表示这一情形，其中弯曲箭头表示米田嵌入（Yoneda embedding）。下面给出一些关于这一概念、在很一般的情形下成立的引理。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换"},{"source_term":"fiber product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"representing object","target_term":"表示对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Yoneda lemma","target_term":"米田引理"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"Yoneda embedding","target_term":"米田嵌入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"transformation","target_term":"变换","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fiber product","target_term":"纤维积","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"representing object","target_term":"表示对象","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Yoneda lemma","target_term":"米田引理","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影","context":"当前词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_